\end{lemma}

\begin{proof}  \uses{lem:Martingale.predictablePart_eq_zero}
By definition of the martingale part, $M = X - A$. By Lemma~\ref{lem:Martingale.predictablePart_eq_zero}, $A = 0$ almost surely, thus $M = X$ almost surely.
